DESCRIPTION:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart!\n**Hello everyone\,
 **\n\nPlease join us for our a great afternoon with **IMPROV and ACTING in
  the PARK!**\n\nIt's a blast! (and no experience required\; just a willing
 ness to have fun\, not take ourselves too seriously and laugh a lot!\n\n\\
 *Joined by my other groups too\; so we can anticipate a great afternoon\n\
 nEvent details below:\n\nSincerely\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\nme
 etup.com/soulcity\n\nEvent Details:\n\n**IMPROV and ACTING in the PARK! (M
 eet at Yonge & Lawrence Corner)**\n(Dinner Party after)\n\nThis is a well 
 organized event filled with Improv\, skits\, sketch comedy and of course l
 ots of hilarious scenes.\n\n-A fun afternoon for all Improv enthusiasts an
 d newbies of Improv!\n\n\\*No experience required\; just an open mind and 
 a desire to meet some wonderful people\, laugh and have fun!\n\n\\*Bring a
  Blanket or a Lawn Chair if you like :) (optional)\n\n**Event Fee:** 10 do
 llars (Cash only) (HST is included)\nor e transfer to steveflemming11@gmai
 l.com\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Friendly Reminders:**\
 n\n**Location and Meeting Spot:**\n\n\\*We will meet outside the **Toronto
  Locke Library (3083 Yonge Street)** then walk 1 minute south to the Lawre
 nce Park. (South East Corner of Yonge and Lawrence)\n\n**(Right beside Sub
 way line\, and plenty of Free Street Parking along Lawrence)**\n\n**-Arriv
 e at 3:00 PM\, we will head down to park together around 3:30**\n-If arriv
 ing late you will see us down at the park- but do your best to come on tim
 e :)\n(The park is one block south of Lawrence\, on East side of Yonge)\n\
